<h1>DSL Library</h1>
<p>Reusable complete instructions. Place a token on its own pipeline step, for example <code>$$META_TITLE$$;$$ARRAY_UNIQ$$</code>.</p>
<p>Library edits apply on the next execution of referencing sources. Body edits leave source algorithms and cached statements unchanged. Renames update complete token references together.</p>
<p><%= link_to "New instruction", new_dsl_library_entry_path %></p>
<table><thead><tr><th>Token</th><th>Description</th><th>Revision</th><th>Instruction</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<% @entries.each do |entry| %><tr>
  <td><%= link_to "$$#{entry.name}$$", edit_dsl_library_entry_path(entry) %></td><td><%= entry.description %></td><td><%= entry.revision %></td><td><pre class="dsl-library-preview dsl-highlight"><%= highlighted_dsl(entry.body) %></pre></td>
</tr><% end %></tbody></table>
<%= will_paginate @entries %>
